      "text": "AQI MAIN / REV B - ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 10,
      "size": 2.4
    },
    {
      "text": "USB-C J1 is the only power/data input (standalone or from battery board J7). Battery % arrives as 100 Hz open-drain PWM on J2 (Dupont, 1=GND 2=BAT_PWM). Buttons: LEFT GPIO8, OK GPIO9 (BOOT), RIGHT GPIO2. J8 (DNP) = external 5 V via D2. TFT top contact confirmed by user. EPD population alternative. One PM module.",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 17
    }
  ],
